H1="Cinematic live action, camera-ready faces in soft, bright, flattering light from the scene's own sources, natural colour."
H2="Shot like a feature film: close shots at eye level with shallow depth of field, the speaking face sharp and the room behind it soft; camera-ready faces, real skin under everyday makeup; every face fully lit and easy to read in soft, bright light from the scene's own source, the shadows open, a catchlight in the eyes; natural colour, skin warm, whites clean; in a single the face turns three-quarter, the eyes to one side of the lens; the camera locked off or pushing in slowly, moving only with someone who walks; the actors play small and real, their eyes on each other. Clean, close, quiet voices over the room's own sound; the place makes its own sounds as they happen. No music and no score. No subtitles or on-screen text."
LANG="Every spoken line is in Brazilian Portuguese, exactly the words in quotes; nobody speaks any other language."
D={"frame":"the same cattle auction ring seen from the sand toward the wooden bleachers, a frame of this film: the bleachers, the ring fence, the buyers seated in the rows and the golden light exactly as they are",
"l1":"a small-town cattle auction ring in the São Paulo countryside: its left panel faces the wooden bleachers, its right panel faces back across the sand ring to the Auctioneer's wooden pulpit with its gavel and the black iron gate beside it",
"c1":"Rosa, one woman of 56, shown from several angles, always in her pale cream blouse with a small pink-and-green floral print, dark hair with grey strands tied back in a low bun",
"c2":"Cleide, one woman of 50, shown from several angles, always in her leopard-print satin blouse and big gold hoop earrings, platinum-blonde blow-dried hair, long red nails",
"c3":"Valdir, one man of 59, shown from several angles, always in his red-and-navy plaid flannel shirt, big silver belt buckle, white cowboy hat, thick grey moustache",
"c4":"Doutor Pelicioni, one man of 45, shown from several angles, always in his navy blazer with a navy pocket square with small white dots, light blue open-collar shirt, dark rectangular glasses, short dark beard with grey",
"c5":"Bruna, one woman of 27, shown from several angles, always in her plain yellow t-shirt and light denim jacket, loose curly dark hair, freckles",
"c6":"Auctioneer, one man of 55, shown from several angles, always in his white long-sleeved shirt and brown leather vest, short grey hair, trimmed grey moustache",
"p1":"Estrela, one red-and-white spotted dairy heifer with short pale horns and a thin sisal rope halter, always with one small R-shaped hot-iron brand on the left side of her neck, the size of a palm, an old healed burn scar with rough paler hair along the letter; her hip clean spotted coat"}
V={"c1":"Rosa: a warm, gentle countrywoman's alto","c2":"Cleide: a husky, sly woman's voice, low register","c3":"Valdir: a deep, gravelly bass","c4":"Doutor Pelicioni: a calm, low baritone","c6":"Auctioneer: a dry, flat baritone"}
CROWD="The rows of the bleachers are filled with buyers, every one an adult of 30 to 65: sun-lined faces, grey and dark hair, straw hats and caps, soft and out of focus."
def prompt(imgs,voices,beats):
    refs=[]
    for n,i in enumerate(imgs,1):
        key="frame" if i.startswith("frame") else i
        refs.append(f"@Image{n} is {D[key]}.")
    pos={i:n for n,i in enumerate(imgs,1)}
    au=[f"@Audio{n} is the voice of @Image{pos[v]}, {V[v]}; every line {'she' if v in ('c1','c2') else 'he'} speaks is in this voice." for n,v in enumerate(voices,1)]
    return "\n\n".join([H1,H2," ".join(refs)," ".join(au),LANG]+beats)+"\n"
C={}
C["k2"]=(["frame:k1@0.5","l1","c1","c2","c6","p1"],["c1","c2","c6"],[
"0-4.6 s: Medium shot from behind Rosa's right shoulder across the sand ring toward the Auctioneer's wooden pulpit, the view of @Image2's right panel: Rosa's shoulder and the back of her head soft at the near left edge of the frame, the sisal rope of @Image6, Estrela, in her right hand; two people in frame: Rosa and the Auctioneer, who stands behind the pulpit holding a handheld microphone, the black iron gate beside him. Rosa turns her face three-quarter toward him and says, in her warm, gentle voice, quiet and asking: \"Doze mil ajuda no depósito da terra.\"",
"4.6-7.6 s: Cut to a medium close-up of Cleide standing in the second row of the bleachers behind the ring fence, the view of @Image1, her face turned three-quarter toward the buyers on her left, eyes to that side of the lens, a wide sweet smile, one hand flat on her chest. "+CROWD+" She says, in her husky, sly voice, sweetly mocking: \"Essa aí não tem onde cair morta.\"",
"7.6-11 s: Cut to a medium close-up of the Auctioneer standing behind his wooden pulpit, the black iron gate soft behind him, his face turned three-quarter toward the ring, brows level, mouth flat; he lowers the microphone to his chest. He says, in his dry, flat baritone: \"Dona Rosa, com acusação eu tiro o lote.\"",
"11-15 s: In silence, a close insert of Rosa's right hand on the sisal rope at her waist, Estrela's spotted neck soft behind it: her fingers tighten around the rope, the knuckles whitening, and stay closed on it to the last frame."])
C["k3"]=(["frame:k1@0.5","l1","c2","c1","c3","c5","p1"],["c2","c1","c3"],[
"0-4.4 s: Medium shot toward the wooden bleachers, the view of @Image1: Cleide walks down two steps from the second row and stops at the wooden ring fence, standing behind it, her hands on its top plank; Valdir sits on the bench behind her. Two people in frame: Cleide and Valdir. "+CROWD+" Cleide leans over the fence toward the ring, face three-quarter to the camera, brows high, and says, in her husky, sly voice, challenging: \"Cadê a nota dela? Cadê o papel?\"",
"4.4-7.6 s: Cut to a medium close-up of Rosa standing in the sand ring, Estrela's white face soft at the edge of the frame on her right, the rope in her hand; her face turned three-quarter toward the fence on her left, eyes to that side of the lens; her eyes glisten, her chin trembles once. She says, in her warm, gentle voice, the voice catching: \"O papel ficou em casa. Deus sabe.\"",
"7.6-11 s: Cut to a medium shot of Valdir rising from the bench and stepping down to stand at the wooden fence beside Cleide, on her right; his face turned three-quarter toward the buyers, a scornful sneer under his grey moustache, one hand waving at the ring. He says, in his deep, gravelly voice, scornful: \"Roça de pobre não cria vaca assim.\"",
"11-15 s: In silence, a medium-wide shot across the sand ring toward the black iron gate, the view of @Image2's right panel, the Auctioneer's empty-handed pulpit beside it: Bruna, alone in frame, comes in through the open gate at a run, in frame from the first frame, stops just inside it on the sand, her chest rising, her face three-quarter toward the bleachers, eyes wide; from 13 s to the last frame Bruna stands just inside the gate."])
C["k4"]=(["frame:k1@0.5","l1","c3","c4","c2","c1","c5","p1"],["c3","c4","c2"],[
"0-3.3 s: Medium close-up of Valdir standing at the wooden ring fence below the bleachers, the view of @Image1, Cleide's leopard-print shoulder soft at the left edge of the frame; his face turned three-quarter toward the ring, brows down, jaw set, his index finger jabbing toward Rosa. He says, in his deep, gravelly voice, hard and threatening: \"Chama a polícia. Ladra não sai daqui.\"",
"3.3-6.3 s: Cut to a medium-wide shot across the sand ring toward the black iron gate, the view of @Image2's right panel: Doutor Pelicioni walks in through the gate, in frame from the first frame, and walks at an unhurried pace across the sand, Bruna one step behind him on his left; two people in frame: Doutor Pelicioni and Bruna. He stops on the sand, his hands loose at his sides.",
"6.3-8.8 s: Cut to a close-up, head and shoulders, of Doutor Pelicioni, who stands in the sand ring beside Rosa, Rosa's floral shoulder soft at the right edge of the frame; his face turned three-quarter toward the fence on his left, eyes on Cleide past the lens, brows level, the faint start of a smile. He says, in his calm, low baritone, unhurried: \"Ela vai dizer que marcou na anca.\"",
"8.8-11.2 s: Cut to a medium close-up of Cleide standing at the wooden fence, the view of @Image1, her face turned three-quarter toward the ring on her right, chin raised, eyes narrowed, a confident smirk. She says, in her husky, sly voice, sure of herself: \"Marquei na anca, sim! Pode olhar!\"",
"11.2-15 s: In silence, a medium-wide shot from the fence side toward the sand ring: Rosa stands in the sand and pulls the sisal rope, and Estrela turns slowly until her right side faces the camera, her hip and rump smooth red-and-white spotted coat; three people in frame: Rosa holding the rope, Doutor Pelicioni standing on her left, and Estrela between Rosa and the camera. From 13.5 s to the last frame Estrela stands still with her clean hip toward the camera."])
C["k5"]=(["frame:k1@0.5","l1","c4","c2","c3","c1","c6","p1"],["c4","c2"],[
"0-2.8 s: Close insert of the left side of Estrela's neck in the golden light: the small R-shaped hot-iron brand at the centre of the frame, the size of Rosa's palm, an old healed burn scar with rough paler hair along the letter; the sisal halter rope across the top of the frame.",
"2.8-5.8 s: Cut to a medium close-up of Doutor Pelicioni standing in the sand ring, his face turned three-quarter toward the fence on his left, eyes on Cleide past the lens, calm, brows level, hands loose at his sides. He says, in his calm, low baritone, like reading the law: \"Na anca, a lei não deixa marcar.\"",
"5.8-9.2 s: Cut to a medium shot over Cleide's left shoulder onto Doutor Pelicioni: Cleide's platinum-blonde hair and leopard-print shoulder soft at the near left edge of the frame; Doutor Pelicioni stands in the sand ring beyond the fence, face three-quarter toward her. He takes a breath and says, in his calm, low baritone, quiet: \"E ladra, na frente de todos, é calúnia.\"",
"9.2-12.2 s: Cut to a medium-wide shot across the sand ring toward the black iron gate, the view of @Image2's right panel: the Auctioneer stands behind his wooden pulpit beside the gate, his arm straight out pointing at the gate; Cleide and Valdir walk along the fence toward the gate, Valdir ahead; three people in frame: the Auctioneer, Cleide and Valdir. At the gate Cleide stops and turns her head back over her shoulder toward the ring, a thin sweet smile. She says, in her husky, sly voice, sweet and poisonous: \"Vende a vaca. O pasto é nosso.\"",
"12.2-15.2 s: In silence, a close insert of the Auctioneer's hand bringing the dark wooden gavel down once on the wooden pulpit, the size of his fist; from 13.5 s to the end of the shot the gavel rests on the pulpit.",
"15.2-18 s: In silence, a medium shot in the sand ring, the wooden bleachers soft behind: Rosa stands holding the sisal rope and strokes Estrela's neck over the R brand with her other hand, her eyes wet and a small smile; Doutor Pelicioni stands on her left, his face turned toward the gate; three in frame: Rosa, Doutor Pelicioni and Estrela, all still to the last frame."])
for k,(i,v,b) in C.items():
    open(f"clip-{k}.txt","w").write(prompt(i,v,b))
